    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u226aStory\u226b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the far reaches of Mizuho, beyond the outskirts of Takakumo City, stands the towering Mount Kumokami.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For centuries, a mysterious phenomenon known as Kamimadoi has caused a strange structure to suddenly appear atop this mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This structure is called the Nabari-no-Miya, and whenever it emerges, hordes of monsters descend upon the nearby villages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the master hidden deep within the Nabari-no-Miya is defeated, the structure vanishes, and the monsters fade with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For generations, the prestigious Itsutsuno family of Takakumo City has bravely entered the Nabari-no-Miya each time it appears, defeating its master to protect the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now, the Nabari-no-Miya has appeared once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chiho Itsutsuno, head of the Itsutsuno family, sets out to fulfill her duty and confront the darkness within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What fate awaits her within those cursed walls\u2026?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/7a87c8577dc3fd0260b0ff3394ceb904.avif?t=1747531401\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u226aActions\u226b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a variety of dynamic moves \u2014 from standard attacks and devastating special moves to double jumps, dodges, and swift dashes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine these skills to conquer enemies and blaze your way through each stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Actions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Normal Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u2192Chain up to 4 consecutive strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Special Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u2192Consume Spirit Energy to unleash a powerful attack that deals massive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Jump Slam Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u2192Create a shockwave on impact, damaging enemies in a wide area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Double Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u2192Leap once more in mid-air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Dodge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u2192Evade enemy attacks with a brief moment of invincibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Dash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u2192Move faster than normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/4f845686a30efda69c6554fdab6d031c.avif?t=1747531401\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u226aCharacters\u226b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Chiho Itsutsuno</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The head of the prestigious Itsutsuno family in Takakumo City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She\u2019s bold, confident, and occasionally a bit reckless \u2014 but she also carries the pride and responsibility of her noble lineage, earning the respect and affection of the townsfolk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/2db86de188e68c055883d2d47efae263.avif?t=1747531401\" width=800 height=1115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Sophia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl clad in elegant, European-style clothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She appears before Chiho as she ventures toward the Nabari-no-Miya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/5f87aaa403c8f21cfffb05c7bf84194f.avif?t=1747531401\" width=800 height=1115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Ushiromaru</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A female merchant who frequently appears within the Nabari-no-Miya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s said she hides her face because of her shy nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She offers Chiho assistance in exchange for gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/3e382635bae98da3d6bff9df68307c0f.avif?t=1747531401\" data-has-big width=800 height=1115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Sakura Yoshino</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl born in the land of Hinomoto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She possesses deer-like ears, antlers, and a tail \u2014 along with physical abilities far beyond those of ordinary people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/a37bd850d4838a4331e72da62809ead1.avif?t=1747531401\" width=800 height=1115 /></span></p>",
