vif?t=1747531401\" width=800 height=1115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Ushiromaru</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A female merchant who frequently appears within the Nabari-no-Miya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s said she hides her face because of her shy nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She offers Chiho assistance in exchange for gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/3e382635bae98da3d6bff9df68307c0f.avif?t=1747531401\" data-has-big width=800 height=1115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Sakura Yoshino</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl born in the land of Hinomoto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She possesses deer-like ears, antlers, and a tail \u2014 along with physical abilities far beyond those of ordinary people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/a37bd850d4838a4331e72da62809ead1.avif?t=1747531401\" width=800 height=1115 /></span></p>",
